Subject: [PATCH] Renew Odoo execution credentials and reload CLI token pairs

Long-running executions outlive their initial scoped token. Rotate credentials
using the pinned runtime and dispatch generation, publish a per-execution
snapshot, and load that snapshot before every CLI API request. Refuse shared
identity fallback and bound transient retries without replaying business writes.

TASK-1-79 (#476)
